          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_schr_dinger_bridges_connect_two",
          "text": "Schrödinger Bridges connect two probability distributions with a diffusion process, but nearly every existing solver is heavy: it stacks several neural networks, needs adversarial min-max training, and can take hours on a GPU.",
