          "chunk_id": "s01_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_result_solves_schr_dinger_bridges",
          "text": "The result solves Schrödinger Bridges in moderate dimensions in minutes on a CPU, with no painful hyperparameter tuning, and is provably a universal approximator of Schrödinger Bridges.",
