        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_min_max_iterative_proportional_fitti",
          "text": "No min-max, no iterative proportional fitting, and no simulation of trajectories during training. Once trained, the same potential gives a closed-form drift, so the full bridge process can be reconstructed directly.",
